Subject: Hide the "Download Deck" card when KNewStuff is not allowed

Under [KDE Action Restrictions] ghns=false the card's NewStuff.Action
disables itself, but the card that carries it stays on the welcome page
and does nothing when clicked. The card now takes the visibility of the
kiosk check the action reads.

--- a/src/qml/WelcomePage.qml
+++ b/src/qml/WelcomePage.qml
@@ -82,6 +82,7 @@
             },
             FormCard.FormGridContainer.InfoCard {
                 title: i18n("Download Deck")
+                visible: NewStuff.Settings.allowedByKiosk
                 action: NewStuff.Action {
                     id: newStuffButton
                     configFile: "kwordquiz.knsrc"
